From 9425cf5e6520b2381175fe4d69f15fcbf4dbe256 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sbwml <admin@cooluc.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 18:59:58 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] fix(stats_api): fix loopback false-positive blocking,
 null answers and optimize memory

- Exclude loopback domain queries (localhost) from ad-blocking while preserving adblock sinkhole rules
- Fix empty answers slice serializing as null instead of empty JSON array
- Exclude RFC 9460 SVCB queries from false-positive ad-blocking on NXDOMAIN
- Connect handleClearCache to FlushAllCaches on cache and dual_selector plugins
- Persist state atomically with fsync and rename to prevent corrupted dumps
- Immediately flush disk dump upon clearing logs
- Optimize RingBuffer and TopStats memory allocations and enforce 20k entry bounds
- Align history retention window to 168 hours (7 days)
